Package: borealfeathers
Title: Colour Palettes Inspired by Boreal Birds
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Meg", "Edgar", , "your.email@ualberta.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Discrete, sequential and diverging colour palettes drawn from
    the plumage of birds of the North American boreal forest and its wetlands,
    with helpers for base graphics and 'ggplot2'. Palettes are checked for
    legibility under simulated colour-vision deficiency.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    grDevices,
    graphics
Suggests:
    colorspace,
    farver,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    knitr,
    magick,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
